      "sender": "Elowen Marr (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Portal",
      "text": "Reported peeling kitchen-cabinet laminate, sharp edges that had caused multiple cuts, and several doors that would not close properly. Noted that two dogs would need to be secured before a visit.",
