      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-06 09:07:13 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "004:L5",
      "event_id": "004",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-06 09:07:13 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked Northbridge Lettings to obtain a quote for replacing the laminate. The message did not specify approval to carry out work.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 246
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L1",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:30:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L2",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:30:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L3",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:30:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "005:L5",
      "event_id": "005",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-07 16:30:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Confirmed that a handyman or suitable contractor would be asked to provide a quotation, and that the price would be returned for approval before work proceeded.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 278
    },
    {
      "id": "006:L1",
      "event_id": "006",
