      "text": "- **Channel:** Update",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 21
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L2",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:18 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 22,
      "end": 85
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L3",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:18 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "- **To:** Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "start": 86,
      "end": 139
    },
    {
      "id": "007:L5",
      "event_id": "007",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:18 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Update",
      "text": "Assigned the contractor and moved the matter into scheduling for an on-site quotation or repair visit under the original laminate-repair scope. The tenant was to provide availability so a slot could be arranged, with access around the dogs.",
      "start": 141,
      "end": 381
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L1",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:37 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L2",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:37 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L3",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:37 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Elowen Marr (Tenant)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "008:L5",
      "event_id": "008",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:37 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Asked for suitable time windows for the contractor's visit and invited the tenant to include any access information relevant to securing the dogs.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 263
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L1",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:43 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L2",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:43 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L3",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:43 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "009:L5",
      "event_id": "009",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 16:50:43 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Advised that a visit was being arranged with the tenant and contractor. No appointment had yet been confirmed.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 228
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L1",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:13:16 UTC",
