      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L2",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:13:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Marr (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Elowen Marr (Tenant)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L3",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:13:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Marr (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "010:L5",
      "event_id": "010",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:13:16 UTC",
      "sender": "Elowen Marr (Tenant)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Offered 16, 17, or 18 September, any time between 11:00 and 14:00. No appointment was confirmed.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 213
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L1",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:14:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L2",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:14:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L3",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:14:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 138
    },
    {
      "id": "011:L5",
      "event_id": "011",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-09 17:14:02 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Forwarded the tenant's offered windows and asked the contractor to select a slot or suggest an alternative. Reiterated the reported cabinet damage and that the dogs needed to be secured before access.",
      "start": 140,
      "end": 340
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L1",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 09:00:17 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L2",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 09:00:17 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 76
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L3",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 09:00:17 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 77,
      "end": 138
    },
    {
      "id": "012:L5",
      "event_id": "012",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 09:00:17 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Said the contractor had previously quoted for a full new kitchen because of the issue. Did not provide the earlier quote or choose one of the tenant's offered visit slots.",
      "start": 140,
      "end": 311
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L1",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:13:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L2",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:13:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L3",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:13:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "013:L5",
      "event_id": "013",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:13:55 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Relayed the contractor's view that the doors were not in a fit state to repair and that a new kitchen might be the practical option. Asked whether the landlord wanted an updated quote. This raised expanded options but did not represent approval for replacement work.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 384
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L1",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:46 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L2",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:46 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 75
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L3",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:46 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 76,
      "end": 137
    },
    {
      "id": "014:L5",
      "event_id": "014",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:46 UTC",
      "sender": "Kellan Rook (Contractor, Alderline Joinery)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Said laminate was peeling from multiple panels and that replacing it properly would require stripping the kitchen, making it more than a straightforward repair. Considered a new kitchen the practical option and said earlier prices could have changed. No current written estimate or site visit was recorded.",
      "start": 139,
      "end": 445
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L1",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:59 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Call",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 19
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L2",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:59 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **From:** Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 20,
      "end": 53
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L3",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:59 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "- **To:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 54,
      "end": 115
    },
    {
      "id": "015:L5",
      "event_id": "015",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 11:14:59 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Call",
      "text": "Voicemail said the landlord was away until 14 September and asked that enquiries be directed to the landlord's office in the meantime.",
      "start": 117,
      "end": 251
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L1",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 15:24:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L2",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 15:24:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 54
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L3",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 15:24:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "016:L5",
      "event_id": "016",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-10 15:24:27 UTC",
      "sender": "Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Agreed to obtain up-to-date estimates for two alternatives: a full new kitchen and replacement cupboards and doors only. Said the appliances, worktops, and flooring were in good condition. This requested estimates; it did not approve either replacement option.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 378
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L1",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 09:46:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L2",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 09:46:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **From:** Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "start": 21,
      "end": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L3",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 09:46:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **To:** Soren Pike (Landlord)",
      "start": 85,
      "end": 116
    },
    {
      "id": "017:L5",
      "event_id": "017",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 09:46:38 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "Confirmed the two requested estimates: a full kitchen, and cupboards and doors only while retaining the existing appliances, worktops, and flooring. Said Northbridge Lettings would report back when both were received.",
      "start": 118,
      "end": 335
    },
    {
      "id": "018:L1",
      "event_id": "018",
      "timestamp": "2025-09-11 15:38:25 UTC",
      "sender": "Nia Calder (Property Manager, Northbridge Lettings)",
      "channel": "Email",
      "text": "- **Channel:** Email",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "018:L2",
